<title>NORWAY: Bergesen revises 1996 net profits up.</title>
<headline>Bergesen revises 1996 net profits up.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's largest shipping company Bergesen ASA said on Thursday it had revised upwards its net result for 1996 by 1.224 billion crowns to 1.603 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The company attributed the adjustment to a new taxation system for Norwegian shipping.</p>
</text>
